      "name": "Strict SNR Dominance of Direct Single-Leaf Readout Over Uncorrected Tree-Merge",
      "statement": "For every depth L >= 1 (K = 2^L >= 2) and every lambda_1 in (0, 1], the ratio of root harmonic SNR proxy (lambda_1^(2^(L+1))) to K-copy single-leaf harmonic SNR proxy (2^L * lambda_1^2) equals 2^(-L) * lambda_1^(2*(2^L - 1)) <= 2^(-L) < 1."
    }
  ],
